<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to inject 9.292 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to inject 9.292 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico sought to inject 9.292 billion pesos in the secondary market on Friday through six credit auctions, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were offered as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM</p>
<p>1.597 bln  11 days</p>
<p>1.597 bln  10 days</p>
<p>    1.598 bln   6 days</p>
<p>    2.000 bln   5 days</p>
<p>    1.500 bln   4 days</p>
<p>    1.000 bln   3 days</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>- Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9559</p>
</text>
